      "content": "the \"worth\" thing doesn't really matter though. even if i am \"worth\" something, it doesnt change the fact that im just a ghost. like i'm looking at my phone and there is nothing. i go to places and i'm just not there. its like i've already died, just in a weird way that hasn't caught up yet. do you ever feel like you're just... done?",
